ab1-62796fdabb24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ae8e88b8d70373be3101d9e364c91bb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/caf68bb9/uploads/origins/53b0dd4e-2fcb-4c22-bab1-62796fdabb24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0dd4067d060f2d601c9fa513412e8b3f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/caf68bb9/uploads/origins/53b0dd4e-2fcb-4c22-bab1-62796fdabb24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0dd4067d060f2d601c9fa513412e8b3f, https://si.imgix.net/caf68bb9/uploads/origins/53b0dd4e-2fcb-4c22-bab1-62796fdabb24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8e607120db61eeb98893479b1043e48 2x, https://si.imgix.net/caf68bb9/uploads/origins/53b0dd4e-2fcb-4c22-bab1-62796fdabb24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bacfed85cb8aed079807effbbb609584 3x"}, "body": "Dear Mr. iz\nI apologize for the length of this long message.\n\n\u3000I love your cute pictures that can receive various things at once, as if the aura of charm has created a shape and it has been there for a long time.\n\nI would like you to make four mysterious animals and give them names. (I would be happy if the creatures are as mysterious as a cat-dragon.\n\u3000I have a \"Silhouette Detective Kit\" that I am trying to make, and I would like to use it as one of the cards.\n\nI don't know how to send you the materials, so I will post the link I mumbled on Twitter. I apologize for my catastrophically bad explanation.\nThe second through fourth examples are the results of the prototypes when they were tested.\n\nThe simple explanation is this play.\n\n[Steps to play Silhouette Detective Kit\nThere is a story about a bad pair of scissors that has torn apart the bodies of the animals, and they need to fix everyone's body to save them.\n\n1) Look at the animal samples.\n\u2461Express the silhouettes of the animals by combining the shapes of the sheets\n(3) Animals regain their bodies\n\n\nI am thinking of preparing a photo and illustration of the animal samples, and I was wondering if you could draw some of the illustrations for me.\n(I draw 80% of the illustrations myself, but I came to skeb thinking that I would like this research twice as much if I could have my favorite illustrator do the illustrations as well.)\n\n\u3000At this stage, I am not thinking of selling my works, and this is just a trial stage of my research (more of a hobby). Ideally, I want to wipe away the painful memories and sense of difficulty that children and adults have when it comes to \"making things,\" and I have made a plan to make various things more fun.\n\n\n\u3000Sorry for the long time!\n\u3000Please feel free to take my request as just a hobby and I would be happy if you could write it for me.\n\u3000If you have time, I'd appreciate it!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/memomomomomemo/status/1595741947221913600?s=20&t=VKMsH7D4rrg996gTidG71A", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@12is_iz/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/916775bd/uploads/origins/15bf0574-8075-4e15-9a5a-b9d676f26418?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7a6bf861705c9b6dc6f13f17a97a0815", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/916775bd/uploads/origins/15bf0574-8075-4e15-9a5a-b9d676f26418?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7a6bf861705c9b6dc6f13f17a97a0815, https://si.imgix.net/916775bd/uploads/origins/15bf0574-8075-4e15-9a5a-b9d676f26418?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8b672fbe097a13a1adae654a8a530d6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/916775bd/uploads/origins/15bf0574-8075-4e15-9a5a-b9d676f26418?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bfe57a970f1c9b5e79824f12a271ae3d 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1997080, "client_id": 1720034, "nc": 1}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": 1778637696.33077}]}, "custom": {}}